+
+### Tracking XGrammar memory deltas
+
+The XGrammar processor factories can enable RSS-delta tracking with
+`track_memory_usage=True`. `get_memory_stats()` reports lifetime call, peak,
+and average statistics; `memory_history_limit` independently bounds the recent
+per-call history (`None` keeps all entries and zero keeps none). Sampling
+failures contribute a zero delta without interrupting generation. `reset()`
+clears the statistics and grammar state while preserving the tracking options.
